#import "/_lib/0.1.1.typ": *
#show: template

#taxon[Remark]
// #title[Title]

In cases where only depends on the cardinality of $A$, i.e $Gamma$ is of the form $Gamma(A,y) ~= G(|A|)$, for some $G : product_(n : NN)  sum_(H : "Group") |U G| = n$, the dirichlet type simplifies to
$
  D(F, Gamma, S) ~= sum_(A: "FinSet") F(A) xx (S -> B G(|A|)),
$

